  "prefLabel": "Per-A 205.02 Presumption",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 205.02 Presumption. All tapes, transcripts, exhibits, decisions, motions and other portions of the record of any appeal shall be available for examination by the public unless the board determines that some or all of that material is exempt from disclosure under RSA 91-A: 5 or applicable case law.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 200) #7378, eff 10-23-00; ss by #9205, eff 10-23-08",
